WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.218
In More → Record Entry / Siri, tap the Shortcuts button.

2
00:00:08.218 --> 00:00:16.144
Touch and hold one of the three preset recording options. This example uses Record Entry.

3
00:00:16.144 --> 00:00:24.869
Choose Add to Home Screen, then tap the checkmark.

4
00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:32.500
Next time, just tap Record Entry on the Home Screen.

5
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:40.500
Enter a description and amount, then tap Done. For example, Lunch USD 12.80.

6
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:45.833
The entry was added without opening the app. Review the pending entry later in Transactions.
